01:19.200 --> 01:22.900
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:22.900 --> 01:24.233
Dim lights.
灯光昏暗。

01:24.233 --> 01:26.633
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:26.633 --> 01:29.567
* Sleep, little Squidward,
catch some winks *
* 睡觉吧，小章鱼哥，
眨眼*

01:29.567 --> 01:34.233
* Everything and everybody
clearly stinks *
* 一切和每个人
明显有臭味*

01:34.233 --> 01:36.800
- [belches]
- [screams]
- [打嗝]
- [尖叫]

01:36.800 --> 01:39.733
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:41.067 --> 01:43.167
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:43.167 --> 01:45.800
Oh, yeah!
Fizz Bomb Cola!
哦，是啊！
嘶嘶炸弹可乐！

01:45.800 --> 01:47.900
- Fire in the hole!
- 洞里着火了！

01:47.900 --> 01:50.100
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

01:50.100 --> 01:51.167
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:51.167 --> 01:52.533
