Hey!
- [大喊]
嘿！

01:52.533 --> 01:55.733
Will you two psychopaths
keep it down?
你们两个精神病患者会吗
保持低调？

01:55.733 --> 01:57.267
- Oh, hi, Squidward.
How ya doing?
-哦，嗨，章鱼哥。
你怎么样？

01:57.267 --> 02:01.400
- Horrible!
I haven't slept for three days.
- 太可怕了！
我已经三天没睡觉了。

02:01.400 --> 02:02.900
- Hey, that's great!
- 嘿，太好了！

02:02.900 --> 02:04.233
- It is not great.
- 这不太好。

02:04.233 --> 02:05.433
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:05.433 --> 02:06.700
I've got an audition
我有一个试镜

02:06.700 --> 02:09.067
with the Bikini Bottom
Philharmonic Orchestra
与比基尼泳裤
爱乐乐团

02:09.067 --> 02:12.800
tomorrow morning,
and I'm a nervous wreck.
明天早上，
我神经衰弱。

02:12.800 --> 02:14.467
- Why don't you
try taking a walk?
- 你为什么不呢
尝试散步吗？

02:14.467 --> 02:16.333
Works for me.
- You know, normally,
对我有用。
- 你知道，通常情况下，

02:16.333 --> 02:19.467
I jump up and scream
when you appear like that.
我跳起来尖叫
当你出现那样的时候。

02:19.467 --> 02:22.100
But I'm so tired,
I'm just gonna take
但我实在是太累了
我只是要采取

02:22.100 --> 02:24.633
your stupid advice.
你愚蠢的建议。

02:28.333 --> 02:30.300
- No, Patrick, no!
- 不，帕特里克，不！

02:30.300 --> 02:31.700
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

02:31.700 --> 02:33.333
- We've got to keep it quiet.
- 我们必须保持安静。

02:33.333 --> 02:35.067
[stomach gurgling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

02:35.067 --> 02:37.333
- Tell my parents
I love them.
- 告诉我的父母
我爱他们。

02:37.333 --> 02:38.333
- Ahh!
[grunts]
- 啊！
[咕哝]

02:38.333 --> 02:40.633
[inhales, grunts]
[吸气，咕哝]

02:42.967 --> 02:44.500
Hit the dirt!
撞上泥土！

02:46.400 --> 02:49.533
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

02:51.633 --> 02:53.700
[gulps]
[吞咽]

02:53.700 --> 02:55.200
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:55.200 --> 02:57.700
That was sheer beauty.
那是纯粹的美丽。

02:57.700 --> 03:02.100
- Taking a walk...walk...
- 散步...散步...

03:02.100 --> 03:04.733
walk.
走。

03:04.733 --> 03:06.333
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:06.333 --> 03:09.333
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:09.333 --> 03:11.367
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:11.367 --> 03:14.867
[sheep bleating]
[羊咩咩叫]

03:14.867 --> 03:17.267
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:17.267 --> 03:20.067
Home.
家。

03:20.067 --> 03:21.800
[door creaks]
[门吱吱作响]

03:23.367 --> 03:26.367
[both munching]
[两人都在咀嚼]

03:26.367 --> 03:29.367
