- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:39.233 --> 03:40.800
- Ahh!
[grunts]
- 啊！
[咕哝]

03:42.867 --> 03:45.267
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:45.267 --> 03:47.433
- Aw, poor guy
was just sleepy.
- 噢，可怜的家伙
只是困了。

03:47.433 --> 03:49.400
Looks like we're
gonna be here a while.
看来我们是
会在这里待一段时间。

03:49.400 --> 03:50.933
See you in the morning, Patrick.
早上见，帕特里克。

03:50.933 --> 03:55.800
