I should probably...
- 哦，是的。
我或许应该...

03:55.800 --> 03:57.200
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:57.200 --> 03:59.800
[snores]
[打鼾]

03:59.800 --> 04:01.300
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:01.300 --> 04:04.767
- Aww.
- 哇。

04:04.767 --> 04:06.067
Aww.
哇。

04:06.067 --> 04:07.533
[all snoring]
[全都打呼噜]

04:09.300 --> 04:11.233
- [crows]
- [乌鸦]

04:11.233 --> 04:13.800
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:15.567 --> 04:18.733
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

04:18.733 --> 04:20.067
[yells]
[喊叫]

04:20.067 --> 04:23.067
This isn't my rug!
Where--where am I?
这不是我的地毯！
我在哪里？

04:23.067 --> 04:23.933
Who am I?
我是谁？

04:23.933 --> 04:25.967
[panting]
Who am I?
[气喘吁吁]
我是谁？

04:25.967 --> 04:27.667
How am I?
- Patrick, Patrick, calm down.
我怎么样？
- 帕特里克，帕特里克，冷静点。

04:27.667 --> 04:30.600
You're at my house.
Oh, and that is your rug.
你在我家。
哦，那是你的地毯。

04:30.600 --> 04:32.700
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

04:32.700 --> 04:35.567
Ruggie, Ruggie, Ruggie.
鲁吉，鲁吉，鲁吉。

04:35.567 --> 04:37.800
Ruggie, Ruggie,
Ruggie.
鲁吉，鲁吉，
鲁吉.

04:37.800 --> 04:40.833
- Squidward, time to wake up.
- 章鱼哥，该起床了。

04:40.833 --> 04:43.600
Wake up, little Squidward.
醒醒吧，小章鱼哥。

04:43.600 --> 04:45.067
Patrick,
Squidward won't wake up.
帕特里克，
章鱼哥不会醒来。

04:45.067 --> 04:48.800
- Ruggie, Ruggie,
Ruggie, Ruggie!
- 鲁吉，鲁吉，
鲁吉，鲁吉！

04:48.800 --> 04:50.733
[yelling]
Wake up, little Squidward,
[大喊]
醒来吧，小章鱼哥

04:50.733 --> 04:52.667
