Wake up, wake up,
[一起念诵]
醒来吧，醒来吧，

04:56.267 --> 04:57.933
wake up, wake up!
醒醒，醒醒！

04:57.933 --> 04:59.167
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:59.167 --> 05:01.467
[coffee dripping]
[咖啡滴落]

05:02.533 --> 05:04.533
[hissing]
[嘶嘶声]

05:04.533 --> 05:06.133
both: Wake up!
两人：醒醒！

05:06.133 --> 05:07.433
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

05:07.433 --> 05:09.933
[electric guitar trilling]
[电吉他颤音]

05:09.933 --> 05:11.467
both: Wake up!
两人：醒醒！

05:11.467 --> 05:13.467
- [snoring]
- Patrick, this is bad.
- [打鼾]
- 帕特里克，这很糟糕。

05:13.467 --> 05:14.867
Squidward won't make
his audition
章鱼哥不会做
他的试镜

05:14.867 --> 05:17.467
with the Philharmonic Orchestra.
What can we do?
与爱乐乐团合作。
我们能做什么？

05:17.467 --> 05:21.800
