【机械磨削】

05:27.433 --> 05:29.133
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:29.133 --> 05:31.300
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:31.300 --> 05:33.233
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:33.233 --> 05:34.233
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

05:34.233 --> 05:35.400
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:35.400 --> 05:37.333
[growling]
[咆哮]

05:37.333 --> 05:41.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:41.067 --> 05:44.067
[smashing]
[粉碎]

05:45.067 --> 05:46.667
- Eureka!
- 尤里卡！

05:46.667 --> 05:49.067
- No, Patrick.
It didn't work.
- 不，帕特里克。
它不起作用。

05:49.067 --> 05:52.667
- Ooh, we've tried everything
under the ocean,
- 哦，我们已经尝试了一切
在海洋之下，

05:52.667 --> 05:55.100
and we failed.
我们失败了。

05:55.100 --> 05:57.767
If only we could just
crawl up inside Squidward
如果我们能
爬进章鱼哥里面

05:57.767 --> 05:59.800
and play him like a puppet.
并把他当作一个木偶。

05:59.800 --> 06:01.333
- That's it!
We could crawl up
- 就是这样！
我们可以爬上去

06:01.333 --> 06:03.967
inside Squidward
and play him like a puppet!
章鱼哥里面
把他当木偶玩！

06:03.967 --> 06:06.867
- Oh, whose dumb idea was that?
- 哦，这是谁的愚蠢主意？

06:06.867 --> 06:07.833
- Yours.
- 你的。

06:07.833 --> 06:09.500
- Well, it sounds good to me.
- 嗯，对我来说听起来不错。

06:10.500 --> 06:12.300
- Okay, Patrick, you go in first
- 好吧，帕特里克，你先进去

06:12.300 --> 06:13.533
