[笑]

06:21.667 --> 06:23.667
It tickles.
很痒。

06:23.667 --> 06:24.933
- How's that feel, buddy?
- 感觉怎么样，伙计？

06:24.933 --> 06:28.533
- Not bad.
Okay, get on my shoulders.
- 不错。
好吧，站到我的肩膀上吧。

06:28.533 --> 06:30.133
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:34.233 --> 06:37.233
Okay, Patrick, I'm gonna see
if I can make Squidward talk.
好吧，帕特里克，我会看看
如果我能让章鱼哥开口说话。

06:39.067 --> 06:41.133
[as Squidward]
My name is Squidward,
[饰演章鱼哥]
我的名字是章鱼哥

06:41.133 --> 06:44.067
and I think SpongeBob
is a lamebrain.
我认为海绵宝宝
是一个跛脑。

06:44.067 --> 06:45.333
[laughs]
[笑]

06:45.333 --> 06:47.233
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:47.233 --> 06:50.667
Wow, you sound more like him
than--
哇，你听起来更像他
比——

06:50.667 --> 06:52.800
than Squidward.
[laughs]
比章鱼哥。
[笑]

06:52.800 --> 06:54.700
- All right, Patrick,
we've got a date
- 好吧，帕特里克，
我们有个约会

06:54.700 --> 06:56.400
at the Bikini Bottom
Philharmonic.
在比基尼底部
爱乐乐团。

06:56.400 --> 06:57.833
Let's get going.
我们开始吧。

06:57.833 --> 07:01.433
[as Squidward]
Whoa, whoops.
[饰演章鱼哥]
哇哦。

07:01.433 --> 07:03.700
Watch out.
Take it easy.
当心。
别紧张。

07:03.700 --> 07:05.300
[jackhammer pounding]
[手提钻敲击声]

07:05.300 --> 07:06.733
- Hey!
- 嘿！

07:06.733 --> 07:08.567
- Left foot, right foot.
- 左脚，右脚。

07:08.567 --> 07:10.433
[both exclaiming]
[两人惊呼]

07:10.433 --> 07:13.567
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:14.567 --> 07:16.400
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:16.400 --> 07:19.733
- [frantic muttering]
- [疯狂的嘀咕]

07:19.733 --> 07:22.500
Whoa!
Excuse me.
哇！
打扰一下。

07:22.500 --> 07:23.733
Sorry.
- Yeah?
对不起。
- 是的？

07:23.733 --> 07:24.800
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:24.800 --> 07:27.233
[explosion]
[爆炸]

07:27.233 --> 07:29.067
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:31.333 --> 07:32.333
- Pardon me.
- 请原谅我。

07:32.333 --> 07:33.600
- Hey, Twinkle Toes,
- 嘿，闪闪发光的脚趾，

07:33.600 --> 07:36.233
you're in a no dancing zone.
你处于禁止跳舞的区域。

07:36.233 --> 07:37.267
Now beat it.
现在打败它。

07:37.267 --> 07:39.333
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:41.233 --> 07:42.800
Patrick, I just realized
I don't know
帕特里克，我刚刚意识到
我不知道

07:42.800 --> 07:44.167
where the concert hall is.
音乐厅在哪里。

07:44.167 --> 07:46.400
[epic music]
[史诗音乐]

07:46.400 --> 07:48.400
Uh, let's ask someone.
呃，我们去问问某人吧。

07:48.400 --> 07:49.700
- Whoa!
- 哇！

07:49.700 --> 07:51.100
[as Squidward]
- Excuse me, ma'am.
[饰演章鱼哥]
- 对不起，女士。

07:51.100 --> 07:53.900
I'm looking for
the concert hall.
我正在寻找
音乐厅。

07:54.967 --> 07:57.400
[grunting]
Whoa!
[咕噜声]
哇！

07:57.400 --> 07:59.800
- Young man, you don't need
a concert hall.
- 年轻人，你不需要
音乐厅。

07:59.800 --> 08:02.067
You need a hospital.
你需要一家医院。

08:02.067 --> 08:04.200
- Great Neptune,
you're hideous!
- 伟大的海王星，
你太丑了！

08:04.200 --> 08:06.433
I manage a freak show,
and you're exactly
我主持了一场怪诞表演，
而你正是

08:06.433 --> 08:07.867
the kind of act I need.
我需要的那种行为。

08:07.867 --> 08:09.367
- Mommy, look.
- 妈妈，看。

08:09.367 --> 08:11.800
It's Frankenstein!
这是弗兰肯斯坦！

08:11.800 --> 08:14.933
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

08:16.067 --> 08:17.567
- Oh, Patrick!
That bus is going
- 哦，帕特里克！
那辆公共汽车正在行驶

08:17.567 --> 08:18.633
to the concert hall!
去音乐厅！

08:18.633 --> 08:22.200
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

08:22.200 --> 08:24.800
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:24.800 --> 08:27.967
[coin clinking]
[硬币叮当作响]

08:27.967 --> 08:29.500
Patrick, do you
have any change?
帕特里克，你吗
有什么变化吗？

08:29.500 --> 08:30.900
- One second.
- 一秒钟。

08:32.467 --> 08:33.400
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

08:35.200 --> 08:39.233
- Hey, I wasn't born yesterday.
That'll be three fares.
- 嘿，我不是昨天出生的。
那就三块钱吧

08:39.233 --> 08:40.767
[coins clinking]
[硬币叮当作响]

08:40.767 --> 08:43.667
Hmm, what some people
won't do to cheat the system.
嗯，有些人
不会欺骗系统。

08:46.133 --> 08:49.067
[fanfare]
[大张旗鼓]

08:50.533 --> 08:51.900
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:51.900 --> 08:53.900
- And don't come back!
- 别回来！

08:53.900 --> 08:57.633
- Oh, man.
That conductor's brutal.
- 哦，伙计。
那个指挥太残忍了

08:57.633 --> 09:00.700
[both grunting and exclaiming]
[一边咕哝一边惊呼]

09:00.700 --> 09:02.367
- Whoa!
- 哇！

09:02.367 --> 09:04.100
- Oh, oof!
- 哦，哦！

09:05.233 --> 09:07.067
- [as Squidward]
I was just, oh, um,
- [作为章鱼哥]
我只是，哦，嗯，

09:07.067 --> 09:09.567
the thing is not on the thing.
Oh, uh...
东西不在东西上。
哦，呃...

09:09.567 --> 09:13.067
- Who is that imbecile?
- Squidward Tentacles.
- 谁是那个低能儿？
- 章鱼哥的触手。

09:13.067 --> 09:16.067
Apparently he's
a clarinet player.
显然他是
单簧管演奏者。

09:16.067 --> 09:17.633
- All right,
whenever you're ready.
- 好吧，
每当你准备好时。

09:17.633 --> 09:18.933
- [whispering]
The clarinet,
- [低语]
单簧管，

09:18.933 --> 09:21.900
where's his clarinet?
- Oh, I got it.
他的单簧管在哪里？
- 哦，我明白了。

09:21.900 --> 09:23.167
- Ew, why'd you put it there?
- 呃，你为什么把它放在那里？

09:23.167 --> 09:24.733
- I guess I never actually
- 我想我从来没有真正

09:24.733 --> 09:27.333
thought of the moment
where we'd have to play it.
想到那一刻
我们必须在哪里玩它。

09:27.333 --> 09:29.367
- Let's see, the ability
to play clarinet
- 让我们看看，能力
演奏单簧管

09:29.367 --> 09:31.233
has got to be
in his brain somewhere.
必须是
在他大脑的某个地方。

09:31.233 --> 09:34.067
It's just a matter
of squeezing it out.
这只是一个问题
把它挤出来。

09:34.067 --> 09:34.867
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:34.867 --> 09:35.933
[clarinet squeaking]
[单簧管吱吱声]

09:35.933 --> 09:37.733
[grunting, clarinet squeaking]
[咕噜声，单簧管吱吱声]

09:37.733 --> 09:38.967
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:38.967 --> 09:40.933
All right, thank you, next!
好的，谢谢，下一个！

09:40.933 --> 09:44.200
[delicate melody]
[细腻的旋律]

09:44.200 --> 09:45.200
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:45.200 --> 09:46.200
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

09:46.200 --> 09:51.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:51.067 --> 09:53.433
- He's magnificent.
- 他太棒了。

09:53.433 --> 09:56.933
- What--what's going on here?
Where am I?
- 这--这是怎么回事？
我在哪里？

09:56.933 --> 09:58.433
I'm at the audition.
我正在参加试镜。

09:58.433 --> 10:01.533
I'm playing,
but I'm not in control.
我正在玩，
但我无法控制。

10:01.533 --> 10:05.567
I--I feel like I've been
taken over by something.
我——我感觉我已经
被某物接管。

10:05.567 --> 10:07.033
- What's going on?
- 这是怎么回事？

10:07.033 --> 10:08.667
- I don't know what's happening.
- 我不知道发生了什么事。

10:08.667 --> 10:10.800
I'm losing control!
我要失去控制了！

10:10.800 --> 10:13.433
- Must...gain...
- 必须...获得...

10:13.433 --> 10:14.967
control!
控制！

10:14.967 --> 10:18.333
- That's an unusual
playing style, but still.
- 这是一个不寻常的
打球风格不过如此。

10:18.333 --> 10:20.333
He sounds magnificent.
他听起来很伟大。

10:20.333 --> 10:21.633
- Patrick, I don't think I can
- 帕特里克，我想我不能

10:21.633 --> 10:22.833
command his brain much longer.
指挥他的​​大脑更长时间。

10:22.833 --> 10:24.433
- Me neither, SpongeBob.
- 我也一样，海绵宝宝。

10:24.433 --> 10:27.200
- What was that--
SpongeBob? Patrick?
-那是什么--
海绵宝宝？帕特里克？

10:27.200 --> 10:30.000
You're inside me?
Oh, how did this happen?
你在我体内吗？
哦，这是怎么发生的？

10:30.000 --> 10:31.567
Get out of my mind!
从我的脑海里滚出去！

10:31.567 --> 10:34.367
Get out of my body.
Just--just--just get out!
从我的身体里滚出去。
就——就——就出去！

10:34.367 --> 10:37.300
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

10:39.500 --> 10:42.200
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:42.200 --> 10:43.633
- [gagging]
- [作呕]

10:43.633 --> 10:46.267
[spits]
[吐口水]

10:46.267 --> 10:47.500
both: Ta-da.
两人：哒哒。

10:47.500 --> 10:50.967
- Oh, I am going to
lambaste you two.
- 哦，我要去
骂你们两个。

10:50.967 --> 10:53.967
- You're a wizard.
A magical, musical wizard.
- 你是个巫师。
一位神奇的音乐奇才。

10:53.967 --> 10:56.533
- I--huh? Oh.
- 我 - 嗯？哦。

10:56.533 --> 10:58.167
- Yes, yes!
- 是的，是的！

10:58.167 --> 11:01.667
Oh, bring us to ecstasy,
maestro.
哦，让我们欣喜若狂，
大师。

11:01.667 --> 11:04.133
- I envy you common people.
- 我羡慕你们这些普通人。

11:04.133 --> 11:07.133
For you are about to have
the glorious honor
因为你即将拥有
光荣的荣誉

11:07.133 --> 11:10.067
of hearing me play
Gustav Mollusk's
听我演奏
古斯塔夫软体动物

11:10.067 --> 11:13.067
Symphony Number Five
in C sharp minor.
第五交响曲
升C小调。

11:13.067 --> 11:17.533
For I am in
complete control.
因为我在
完全控制。

11:17.533 --> 11:18.800
[shrill squealing]
[尖锐的尖叫声]

11:18.800 --> 11:19.867
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

11:19.867 --> 11:21.767
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

11:21.767 --> 11:24.700
[cawing and honking]
[呱呱叫和鸣喇叭]

11:24.700 --> 11:27.133
[ice crashing]
[冰崩塌]

11:27.133 --> 11:30.133
[buildings rumbling]
[建筑物隆隆作响]

11:32.800 --> 11:34.633
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

11:34.633 --> 11:35.633
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

11:35.633 --> 11:36.633
[delicate melody]
[细腻的旋律]

11:36.633 --> 11:37.900
Hmm? Huh?
唔？啊？

11:37.900 --> 11:40.933
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

11:40.933 --> 11:42.567
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

11:42.567 --> 11:45.500
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

[人群欢呼]